<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Primal-Dual Direct Preference Optimizationfor Constrained LLM Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Pseudo-code and Detailed Description of Algorithm <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathtt{O\mbox{-}PD\mbox{-}DPO}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝙾</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝙿𝙳</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝙳𝙿𝙾</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathtt{O\mbox{-}PD\mbox{-}DPO}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
